  <item>
    <title>跨年合体：聊聊我们四年的变化和不变</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6772afce15a5fd520ecb303a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6772afce15a5fd520ecb303a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Dec 2024 14:42:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目具有划时代的意义，是西西和鱼仔第一次线下合体录播客！我们聊了这四年来生活的「变」与「不变」。我俩意外地合拍，丝滑畅聊了72分钟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 西西回国休假的日子里，鱼仔恰好不上班了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 《始于极限》里提到的天职、职业和工作的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> 关于鱼仔重获自由，不再硬着头皮“坐班换钱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a> 两人一起在浦东美术馆看展的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 上海和纽约的女装区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a> 播客选题的变化：从最开始讨论生活琐事到持续聊院线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 《不学无术》陪伴我俩换了好几份工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 本年度印象深刻的电影大提名：《姥姥的外孙》《出走的决心》《八部半》等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> 美国大选贯穿了西西的人生十年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a> 不上班，只旅游和恋爱的十二月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3567">59:27</a> 对待亲密关系的内心变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3864">64:24</a> 四年过去，两人依然是稳定的ENFP</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltIXko_tGojgOr9H7FCy9cGa2rOl.m4a" length="105743469" type="audio/mp4"/>
