  <item>
    <title>不够善良的NPC：俗仔不行啦！不要给他爱啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662fe2facb483e20a8b2682a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662fe2facb483e20a8b2682a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Apr 2024 17:42:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《不够善良的我们》终于迎来大结局，连夜看完后被Rebecca的戏份狠狠共情。擦干眼泪后，拉来了也看完剧的MOMO和雷雷，一起聊聊这部开分9分的口碑台剧。</span></p><br><br><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 鱼仔对前三集的第一印象很糟糕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 单身经济和一个人吃饭的经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 何瑞之的一个拥抱都比“谢谢”更好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a> 以为导演要拍成同性片，海边拥抱有点不对劲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> 大于和Rebecca的感情线拍得太绝了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> 双女主的人设和她们的「粒子纠缠」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 身为资深HR的墨墨锐评：性格决定命运</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 场外观众对大结局的不同看法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 分手之后会去看前任过得好不好吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 每个人的生活轨迹不一样，管好你自己！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1872">31:12</a> 大家对「婚内出轨」的看法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 当你见证过朋友不幸福的婚姻，对人性无可指摘</span></p><br><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><p><span>《Hey hey you》——蔡健雅</span></p><br><br><br><br><br><br>]]></description>
